Licenses for the third-party code vendored in extern/clip/
==========================================================

This directory does NOT contain a vendored upstream source tree.  It contains
one ported source file plus one single-header library:

  clip_shim.cpp / clip_shim.h
      Derived from monatis/clip.cpp (https://github.com/monatis/clip.cpp).
      The CLIP model definition, the two transformer towers, the CLIP BPE
      tokenizer and the bicubic image preprocessing are taken from that
      project; the ggml-facing scaffolding was rewritten to run on the
      modern ggml that rampart-llamacpp already builds (see the header
      comment in clip_shim.cpp).  Licensed under the MIT License, below.

  stb_image.h
      stb_image v2.28 by Sean Barrett and contributors
      (https://github.com/nothings/stb).  Dual-licensed: MIT OR public
      domain (Unlicense).  The full text of both is carried at the bottom
      of stb_image.h itself and is not duplicated here.

The ggml tensor library is NOT vendored here -- clip links the single shared
copy under extern/llama.cpp/ggml, which carries its own MIT license at
extern/llama.cpp/LICENSE.


